    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Tempo Territory Strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858880/extras/0104f0ec77020e63bd74c3a4d4e5feee.avif?t=1750334344\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers move on their own, and each round wraps up in just a few minutes. Build various structures, earn money, and grow your population to expand your territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Deck-Building!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858880/extras/0ddf5db9e688665ae17eb7b3b05532c5.avif?t=1750334344\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck-building roguelike where every playthrough unfolds differently. Combine diverse synergies and craft your unique build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxed Asynchronous Battles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete casually with players worldwide in asynchronous matches. Will you impose your own build, or adapt to your opponent's deck? The way you fight is up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream and post videos of gameplay, regardless of your affiliation or whether you monetize your content. No prior contact is necessary.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Tempo Territory Strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858880/extras/0104f0ec77020e63bd74c3a4d4e5feee.avif?t=1750334344\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Villagers move on their own, and each round wraps up in just a few minutes. Build various structures, earn money, and grow your population to expand your territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Deck-Building!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858880/extras/0ddf5db9e688665ae17eb7b3b05532c5.avif?t=1750334344\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deck-building roguelike where every playthrough unfolds differently. Combine diverse synergies and craft your unique build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxed Asynchronous Battles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete casually with players worldwide in asynchronous matches. Will you impose your own build, or adapt to your opponent's deck? The way you fight is up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream and post videos of gameplay, regardless of your affiliation or whether you monetize your content. No prior contact is necessary.</p>",
    "short_description": "High-speed territory control battle! Build structures, earn money, and grow your army to expand your territory. One King Is Enough is a strategy roguelike deck-building game where you compete against players worldwide in asynchronous battles. Outsmart your rivals with your own powerful builds.",
